  "description": "the settings under addons.seats of the experience (D31): seats (player seats: fillers human, agent, program; inputs are trigger names, <scene>/<control id> or choice link ids; view is value names), turns, end, legal, public and agentScores (A4.1) | turns: strict (a string value names the seat on turn; values maps each seat to one of its strings), alternating or simultaneous (order lists the seats); timeoutMs is 100..3600000 on the engine clock; fallback is draw, forfeit, program or one retry then one of those; a program fallback names its program in the seat's program key or in fallback.program | end: done and winner name values; reaching maxMoves (1..4096) is a draw; the event seats:ended {winner} tells the shell and scenes that play ended | legal maps a trigger name to a value holding the payloads the seat may send, at most 256 entries and 65,536 bytes; public lists the values spectators read; agentScores is include or exclude | the agent door calls: seats, join, view, legal, act, leave; an input from an agent or program that reaches a human-only action faults its transaction; a program replies within 15000 ms or forfeits",
